{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_151_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_151","textTraditional":"一、元年，春，王正月，公即位。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_151_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_151","textTraditional":"繼正即立，正也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_151_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_151","textTraditional":"二、仲孫蔑會晉欒黶、宋華元、衞寧殖、曹人、莒人、邾人、滕人、薛人，圍宋彭城。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_151_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_151","textTraditional":"繫彭城於宋者，不與魚石，正也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_151_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_151","textTraditional":"三、夏，晉韓厥帥師伐鄭。仲孫蔑會齊崔杼、曹人、邾人、杞人次於鄫。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_151_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_151","textTraditional":"四、秋，楚公子壬夫帥師侵宋。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_151_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_151","textTraditional":"五、九月，辛酉，天王崩。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_151_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_151","textTraditional":"六、邾子來朝。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_151_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_151","textTraditional":"七、冬，衞侯使公孫剽來聘。晉侯使荀罃來聘。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}